<title>USA: GOLF-SCORES AT U.S. CHAMPIONSHIP MATCH PLAY TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SCORES AT U.S. CHAMPIONSHIP MATCH PLAY TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE OCONEE, Georgia 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>First-round scores at the U.S.Championship match play tournament on Monday (prefix number denotes seeding:</p>
<p>4-Davis Love III beat 5-Corey Pavin</p>
<p>3-Phil Mickelson beat 6-Mark O'Meara</p>
<p>2-Fred Couples beat 7-Steve Stricker</p>
<p>1-Tom Lehman beat 8-Scott Hoch</p>
